{"content_html": "<div>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com fbl eur nations ger gre (1).jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/9/28/editorial-uefa-com-fbl-eur-nations-ger-gre-1-219.jpg?width=0&amp;s=fIINZqE6jTIBsGxNFDxN_Q\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Hy Lạp bị đánh giá thấp hơn hẳn khi phải đi làm khách</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com fbl eur nations ger gre (2).jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/9/28/editorial-uefa-com-fbl-eur-nations-ger-gre-2-220.jpg?width=0&amp;s=_ob2bfUpcw3r5dDjq_FYKA\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Tuyển Đức liên tục đe dọa cầu môn đối phương</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com germany_v_greece_ _uefa_nations_league_2026_27_group_a2_md2 (4).jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/9/28/editorial-uefa-com-germany-v-greece-uefa-nations-league-2026-27-group-a2-md2-4-221.jpg?width=0&amp;s=8TVeM13eZYolHvj_Q27LVw\"/></picture>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com fbl eur nations ger gre.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/9/28/editorial-uefa-com-fbl-eur-nations-ger-gre-222.jpg?width=0&amp;s=yuP9FWYSuM85pjbkPz9X4w\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Vẻ thất vọng của Nmecha khi phung phí cơ hội</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com germany_v_greece_ _uefa_nations_league_